  "implementation": [
    "Add read_retained_correction_archive to session and held source-admission protocols/implementations, returning a complete raw archive without switching existing callers.",
    "Preflight validates exact original USER/scope/IDs, asserts selected submission access before enumeration and uses one read-only repeatable transaction. Held reads require live matching scope and existing parent-lock RPC on the same connection.",
    "Preserve all actors/profiles; compare exact selected parent to a unique enumerated row. Later pure validation, external Documents original checks and final admitted write remain separate.",
    "Three new unit/database test files and owner docs/inventory. Scope extended to the one necessary package.json test-list insertion so next CI can execute the new database cases; every pre-existing file/flag/order and package field remains unchanged."
  ],
